    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾰφᾰν-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>,
